{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"tree":1},[2,20,34],{"slug":3,"title":4,"pages":5},"start","Start",[6,14],{"siteId":7,"section":3,"slug":8,"path":9,"title":10,"description":11,"order":12,"verified":13},"boiler","install","/content/boiler/docs/start/install.md","Install","Prebuilt binaries for seven targets, source builds with Zig 0.16.0, NullHub, or Docker Compose.",1,"v2026.5.29",{"siteId":7,"section":3,"slug":15,"path":16,"title":17,"description":18,"order":19,"verified":13},"quickstart","/content/boiler/docs/start/quickstart.md","Quickstart","Start the orchestrator, pair one NullClaw worker, and run your first task.",2,{"slug":21,"title":22,"pages":23},"guides","Guides",[24,29],{"siteId":7,"section":21,"slug":25,"path":26,"title":27,"description":28,"order":12,"verified":13},"workflow-graphs","/content/boiler/docs/guides/workflow-graphs.md","Workflow graphs","Nodes, edges, state reducers, checkpoints, replay, forking and interrupts.",{"siteId":7,"section":21,"slug":30,"path":31,"title":32,"description":33,"order":19,"verified":13},"workers-and-dispatch","/content/boiler/docs/guides/workers-and-dispatch.md","Workers and dispatch","Worker protocols, tag-based selection, capacity, health checks and drain mode.",{"slug":35,"title":36,"pages":37},"reference","Reference",[38,43],{"siteId":7,"section":35,"slug":39,"path":40,"title":41,"description":42,"order":12,"verified":13},"api","/content/boiler/docs/reference/api.md","HTTP API","All 36 operations — runs, steps, checkpoints, workers, workflows, tracker bridge and admin.",{"siteId":7,"section":35,"slug":44,"path":45,"title":46,"description":47,"order":19,"verified":13},"configuration","/content/boiler/docs/reference/configuration.md","Configuration","Config file resolution, every field with its default, CLI flags and the tracker section."],"uses":{}},{"type":"data","data":[{"doc":1,"raw":10,"dateModified":31,"sectionTitle":32,"prev":33,"next":39},{"siteId":2,"section":3,"slug":4,"path":5,"title":6,"description":7,"order":8,"verified":9,"body":10,"html":11,"toc":12},"boiler","start","quickstart","/content/boiler/docs/start/quickstart.md","Quickstart","Start the orchestrator, pair one NullClaw worker, and run your first task.",2,"v2026.5.29","\nTen minutes from binary to a completed run: one orchestrator, one [NullClaw](https://claw.nullmenu.ai/) worker, one task. NullBoiler only coordinates — the worker does the cooking.\n\n## 1. Start a worker\n\nNullBoiler talks to NullClaw through its gateway. Set a static paired token in the NullClaw config:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"gateway\": {\n    \"host\": \"127.0.0.1\",\n    \"port\": 3000,\n    \"require_pairing\": true,\n    \"paired_tokens\": [\"nb_worker_token_1\"]\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThen start the gateway:\n\n```bash\nnullclaw gateway --port 3000\n```\n\n## 2. Point NullBoiler at it\n\nCreate `config.json` (or copy the repo's `config.example.json` and trim it). The worker uses the same token and an explicit webhook path:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"workers\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"nullclaw-1\",\n      \"url\": \"http://localhost:3000/webhook\",\n      \"token\": \"nb_worker_token_1\",\n      \"protocol\": \"webhook\",\n      \"tags\": [\"coder\"],\n      \"max_concurrent\": 2\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nStart the orchestrator:\n\n```bash\nzig-out/bin/nullboiler --config config.json --port 8080 --db nullboiler.db\n```\n\nCheck it is up:\n\n```bash\ncurl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:8080/health\n```\n\n## 3. Create a run\n\nA run is a set of steps. This one has a single `task` step, routed to any worker tagged `coder`:\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/runs \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{\n    \"input\": {\n      \"repo\": \"openclaw\",\n      \"goal\": \"rewrite tests from TypeScript to Go\"\n    },\n    \"steps\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"rewrite-tests\",\n        \"type\": \"task\",\n        \"worker_tags\": [\"coder\"],\n        \"prompt_template\": \"Repository: {{input.repo}}\\nGoal: {{input.goal}}\\n\\nReturn a concise summary of changed files.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }'\n```\n\nThe response is `{\"id\":\"\u003Crun_id>\",\"status\":\"running\"}`.\n\n## 4. Track progress\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS http://127.0.0.1:8080/runs/\u003Crun_id>\n```\n\nThe final task output is in `steps[].output_json.output`. For finer-grained visibility, `GET /runs/\u003Crun_id>/events` lists persisted events and `GET /runs/\u003Crun_id>/stream` returns a stream snapshot — see the [API reference](/docs/reference/api/).\n\n## 5. Optional: overnight mode\n\nThe built-in `loop` strategy runs one task unit per iteration — up to 1000 iterations — and stops only when the worker returns `BACKLOG_DONE`:\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/runs \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{\n    \"input\": { \"repo\": \"openclaw\", \"task_file\": \"night_tasks.md\" },\n    \"steps\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"night-loop\",\n        \"type\": \"loop\",\n        \"max_iterations\": 1000,\n        \"exit_condition\": \"BACKLOG_DONE\",\n        \"body\": [\"execute-next-task\"]\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"execute-next-task\",\n        \"type\": \"task\",\n        \"worker_tags\": [\"coder\"],\n        \"prompt_template\": \"Repository: {{input.repo}}\\nTask source file: {{input.task_file}}\\n\\nDo exactly one next unchecked task from the file. If no unchecked tasks remain, return exactly: BACKLOG_DONE.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }'\n```\n\n## Where next\n\n- [Workflow graphs](/docs/guides/workflow-graphs/) — nodes, edges, reducers, checkpoints, replay.\n- [Workers and dispatch](/docs/guides/workers-and-dispatch/) — protocols, tags, capacity, health checks.\n- Running against a durable task queue? Pair with [NullTickets](https://tickets.nullmenu.ai/) in pull mode — see the `tracker` section in [Configuration](/docs/reference/configuration/).\n","\u003Cp>Ten minutes from binary to a completed run: one orchestrator, one \u003Ca href=\"https://claw.nullmenu.ai/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"NullClaw (opens in a new tab)\">NullClaw\u003Csvg class=\"functional-icon external-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\">\u003Cg stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\u003Cpath d=\"M8 16 16 8\">\u003C/path>\u003Cpath d=\"M10 8h6v6\">\u003C/path>\u003C/g>\u003C/svg>\u003C/a> worker, one task. NullBoiler only coordinates — the worker does the cooking.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"1-start-a-worker\" aria-labelledby=\"heading-label-1-start-a-worker\">\u003Cspan id=\"heading-label-1-start-a-worker\">1. Start a worker\u003C/span>\u003Ca class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#1-start-a-worker\" aria-label=\"Permalink to 1. Start a worker\" data-pagefind-ignore>\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\">#\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>NullBoiler talks to NullClaw through its gateway. Set a static paired token in the NullClaw config:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cfigure class=\"code-figure\" data-lang=\"json\">\u003Cpre class=\"shiki null-kitchen\" style=\"background-color:#0a0806;color:#d9d1c3\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">{\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">  \"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#ECE5D8\">gateway\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">:\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\"> {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">    \"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#ECE5D8\">host\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">:\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> \"127.0.0.1\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">,\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">    \"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#ECE5D8\">port\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">:\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D9A441\"> 3000\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">,\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">    \"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#ECE5D8\">require_pairing\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">:\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D9A441\"> true\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">,\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">    \"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#ECE5D8\">paired_tokens\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">:\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\"> [\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">\"nb_worker_token_1\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">]\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">  }\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">}\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003Cbutton class=\"code-copy\" type=\"button\" data-code data-pagefind-ignore aria-live=\"polite\">copy\u003C/button>\u003C/figure>\n\u003Cp>Then start the gateway:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cfigure class=\"code-figure\" data-lang=\"bash\">\u003Cpre class=\"shiki null-kitchen\" style=\"background-color:#0a0806;color:#d9d1c3\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#ECE5D8\">nullclaw\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> gateway\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> --port\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D9A441\"> 3000\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003Cbutton class=\"code-copy\" type=\"button\" data-code data-pagefind-ignore aria-live=\"polite\">copy\u003C/button>\u003C/figure>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"2-point-nullboiler-at-it\" aria-labelledby=\"heading-label-2-point-nullboiler-at-it\">\u003Cspan id=\"heading-label-2-point-nullboiler-at-it\">2. Point NullBoiler at it\u003C/span>\u003Ca class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#2-point-nullboiler-at-it\" aria-label=\"Permalink to 2. Point NullBoiler at it\" data-pagefind-ignore>\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\">#\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Create \u003Ccode>config.json\u003C/code> (or copy the repo&#39;s \u003Ccode>config.example.json\u003C/code> and trim it). The worker uses the same token and an explicit webhook path:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cfigure class=\"code-figure\" data-lang=\"json\">\u003Cpre class=\"shiki null-kitchen\" style=\"background-color:#0a0806;color:#d9d1c3\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">{\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">  \"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#ECE5D8\">workers\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">:\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\"> [\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">    {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">      \"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#ECE5D8\">id\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">:\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> \"nullclaw-1\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">,\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">      \"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#ECE5D8\">url\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">:\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> \"http://localhost:3000/webhook\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">,\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">      \"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#ECE5D8\">token\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">:\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> \"nb_worker_token_1\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">,\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">      \"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#ECE5D8\">protocol\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">:\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> \"webhook\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">,\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">      \"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#ECE5D8\">tags\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">:\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\"> [\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">\"coder\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">],\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">      \"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#ECE5D8\">max_concurrent\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">:\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D9A441\"> 2\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">    }\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">  ]\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#8D8375\">}\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003Cbutton class=\"code-copy\" type=\"button\" data-code data-pagefind-ignore aria-live=\"polite\">copy\u003C/button>\u003C/figure>\n\u003Cp>Start the orchestrator:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cfigure class=\"code-figure\" data-lang=\"bash\">\u003Cpre class=\"shiki null-kitchen\" style=\"background-color:#0a0806;color:#d9d1c3\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#ECE5D8\">zig-out/bin/nullboiler\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> --config\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> config.json\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> --port\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D9A441\"> 8080\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> --db\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> nullboiler.db\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003Cbutton class=\"code-copy\" type=\"button\" data-code data-pagefind-ignore aria-live=\"polite\">copy\u003C/button>\u003C/figure>\n\u003Cp>Check it is up:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cfigure class=\"code-figure\" data-lang=\"bash\">\u003Cpre class=\"shiki null-kitchen\" style=\"background-color:#0a0806;color:#d9d1c3\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#ECE5D8\">curl\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> -fsS\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> http://127.0.0.1:8080/health\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003Cbutton class=\"code-copy\" type=\"button\" data-code data-pagefind-ignore aria-live=\"polite\">copy\u003C/button>\u003C/figure>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3-create-a-run\" aria-labelledby=\"heading-label-3-create-a-run\">\u003Cspan id=\"heading-label-3-create-a-run\">3. Create a run\u003C/span>\u003Ca class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#3-create-a-run\" aria-label=\"Permalink to 3. Create a run\" data-pagefind-ignore>\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\">#\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>A run is a set of steps. This one has a single \u003Ccode>task\u003C/code> step, routed to any worker tagged \u003Ccode>coder\u003C/code>:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cfigure class=\"code-figure\" data-lang=\"bash\">\u003Cpre class=\"shiki null-kitchen\" style=\"background-color:#0a0806;color:#d9d1c3\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#ECE5D8\">curl\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> -sS\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> -X\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> POST\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> http://127.0.0.1:8080/runs\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D9A441\"> \\\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">  -H\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> 'Content-Type: application/json'\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D9A441\"> \\\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">  -d\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> '{\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">    \"input\": {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">      \"repo\": \"openclaw\",\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">      \"goal\": \"rewrite tests from TypeScript to Go\"\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">    },\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">    \"steps\": [\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">      {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">        \"id\": \"rewrite-tests\",\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">        \"type\": \"task\",\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">        \"worker_tags\": [\"coder\"],\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">        \"prompt_template\": \"Repository: {{input.repo}}\\nGoal: {{input.goal}}\\n\\nReturn a concise summary of changed files.\"\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">      }\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">    ]\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">  }'\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003Cbutton class=\"code-copy\" type=\"button\" data-code data-pagefind-ignore aria-live=\"polite\">copy\u003C/button>\u003C/figure>\n\u003Cp>The response is \u003Ccode>{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;&lt;run_id&gt;&quot;,&quot;status&quot;:&quot;running&quot;}\u003C/code>.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"4-track-progress\" aria-labelledby=\"heading-label-4-track-progress\">\u003Cspan id=\"heading-label-4-track-progress\">4. Track progress\u003C/span>\u003Ca class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#4-track-progress\" aria-label=\"Permalink to 4. Track progress\" data-pagefind-ignore>\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\">#\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cfigure class=\"code-figure\" data-lang=\"bash\">\u003Cpre class=\"shiki null-kitchen\" style=\"background-color:#0a0806;color:#d9d1c3\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#ECE5D8\">curl\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> -sS\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> http://127.0.0.1:8080/runs/\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D97742\">&#x3C;\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">run_i\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D9D1C3\">d\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D97742\">>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003Cbutton class=\"code-copy\" type=\"button\" data-code data-pagefind-ignore aria-live=\"polite\">copy\u003C/button>\u003C/figure>\n\u003Cp>The final task output is in \u003Ccode>steps[].output_json.output\u003C/code>. For finer-grained visibility, \u003Ccode>GET /runs/&lt;run_id&gt;/events\u003C/code> lists persisted events and \u003Ccode>GET /runs/&lt;run_id&gt;/stream\u003C/code> returns a stream snapshot — see the \u003Ca href=\"/docs/reference/api/\">API reference\u003C/a>.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"5-optional-overnight-mode\" aria-labelledby=\"heading-label-5-optional-overnight-mode\">\u003Cspan id=\"heading-label-5-optional-overnight-mode\">5. Optional: overnight mode\u003C/span>\u003Ca class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#5-optional-overnight-mode\" aria-label=\"Permalink to 5. Optional: overnight mode\" data-pagefind-ignore>\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\">#\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>The built-in \u003Ccode>loop\u003C/code> strategy runs one task unit per iteration — up to 1000 iterations — and stops only when the worker returns \u003Ccode>BACKLOG_DONE\u003C/code>:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cfigure class=\"code-figure\" data-lang=\"bash\">\u003Cpre class=\"shiki null-kitchen\" style=\"background-color:#0a0806;color:#d9d1c3\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#ECE5D8\">curl\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> -sS\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> -X\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> POST\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> http://127.0.0.1:8080/runs\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D9A441\"> \\\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">  -H\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> 'Content-Type: application/json'\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D9A441\"> \\\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">  -d\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\"> '{\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">    \"input\": { \"repo\": \"openclaw\", \"task_file\": \"night_tasks.md\" },\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">    \"steps\": [\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">      {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">        \"id\": \"night-loop\",\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">        \"type\": \"loop\",\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">        \"max_iterations\": 1000,\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">        \"exit_condition\": \"BACKLOG_DONE\",\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">        \"body\": [\"execute-next-task\"]\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">      },\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">      {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">        \"id\": \"execute-next-task\",\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">        \"type\": \"task\",\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">        \"worker_tags\": [\"coder\"],\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">        \"prompt_template\": \"Repository: {{input.repo}}\\nTask source file: {{input.task_file}}\\n\\nDo exactly one next unchecked task from the file. If no unchecked tasks remain, return exactly: BACKLOG_DONE.\"\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">      }\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">    ]\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C9B795\">  }'\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003Cbutton class=\"code-copy\" type=\"button\" data-code data-pagefind-ignore aria-live=\"polite\">copy\u003C/button>\u003C/figure>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-next\" aria-labelledby=\"heading-label-where-next\">\u003Cspan id=\"heading-label-where-next\">Where next\u003C/span>\u003Ca class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#where-next\" aria-label=\"Permalink to Where next\" data-pagefind-ignore>\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\">#\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"/docs/guides/workflow-graphs/\">Workflow graphs\u003C/a> — nodes, edges, reducers, checkpoints, replay.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"/docs/guides/workers-and-dispatch/\">Workers and dispatch\u003C/a> — protocols, tags, capacity, health checks.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Running against a durable task queue? Pair with \u003Ca href=\"https://tickets.nullmenu.ai/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"NullTickets (opens in a new tab)\">NullTickets\u003Csvg class=\"functional-icon external-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\">\u003Cg stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\u003Cpath d=\"M8 16 16 8\">\u003C/path>\u003Cpath d=\"M10 8h6v6\">\u003C/path>\u003C/g>\u003C/svg>\u003C/a> in pull mode — see the \u003Ccode>tracker\u003C/code> section in \u003Ca href=\"/docs/reference/configuration/\">Configuration\u003C/a>.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n",[13,16,19,22,25,28],{"id":14,"text":15,"depth":8},"1-start-a-worker","1. Start a worker",{"id":17,"text":18,"depth":8},"2-point-nullboiler-at-it","2. Point NullBoiler at it",{"id":20,"text":21,"depth":8},"3-create-a-run","3. Create a run",{"id":23,"text":24,"depth":8},"4-track-progress","4. Track progress",{"id":26,"text":27,"depth":8},"5-optional-overnight-mode","5. Optional: overnight mode",{"id":29,"text":30,"depth":8},"where-next","Where next","2026-07-16","Start",{"siteId":2,"section":3,"slug":34,"path":35,"title":36,"description":37,"order":38,"verified":9,"sectionTitle":32},"install","/content/boiler/docs/start/install.md","Install","Prebuilt binaries for seven targets, source builds with Zig 0.16.0, NullHub, or Docker Compose.",1,{"siteId":2,"section":40,"slug":41,"path":42,"title":43,"description":44,"order":38,"verified":9,"sectionTitle":45},"guides","workflow-graphs","/content/boiler/docs/guides/workflow-graphs.md","Workflow graphs","Nodes, edges, state reducers, checkpoints, replay, forking and interrupts.","Guides"],"uses":{"params":["section","slug"]}}]}
